    "comparison": "Five paired fresh isolated app sessions per app. Off: no optimizer engine/tray. On: tested production Core in an owned-PID-only test host plus actual packaged lightweight tray. Same eight background child PIDs and fixed external memory allocation within each pair. No app/renderer is mutated.",
