    "memory": "External pressure actor calibrated once per pair toward768MiB available and held fixed. Continues one byte/page reads every2s. Actual headroom recorded; no per-condition rematching. Reserve1GiB Commit before allocation; >90%Commit or <128MiB available for2s releases pressure and censors the pair.",
    "chrome": "Local deterministic dashboard:20,000 records,1,000 filtered DOM rows. Thirty trusted search-input events and thirty trusted sort clicks/condition. Primary endpoint client dispatch→observed double-requestAnimationFrame boundary; JS event→frame and script time secondary. This is a browser UI workflow fixture, not a live website or physical screen-presentation measurement.",
    "vscode": "Actual built-in TypeScript completion and document edit/save via isolated Extension Development Host. Generated5,000-row TypeScript document. Thirty edit→completion and thirty edit→save operations/condition; internal VS Code API promise times. Completion must include id/label/score/group; disk must match editor; final paired hashes must match.",
    "warmup": "Initial idle5-operation readiness warmup before background load. Each condition:12s settle, reset,5 unreported warmup operations,reset,1s settle. Startup/indexing excluded; the cold preflight observation is separately retained.",
